  "notes": [
    "resolution is the public mathematical status; status is the private moderation state and must not be submitted.",
    "A PDF hosted in a repository uses publication=announcement, not preprint.",
    "Claim only lean-checked when the selected theorem has a clean build and axiom evidence but no independent statement audit; lean-verified requires the additional independent anchor.",
